            "text": "<p>“I heard about micro-infusion in clinics but couldn’t afford to fork out hundreds of dollars for a treatment. So when I saw this online I jumped at buying it instantly. Yes, it doesn’t stamp in botox and filler BUT personally I LOVE the results and how easy it is to use myself at home. It works great for my skin, I have noticed my skin texture is much smoother and brighter.”</p>",
